{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe air in Vienna is thick with autumn, but my spirits remain high. I wandered the Prater this afternoon; it is a magnificent spectacle of light and life, though I confess I grew weary of the crowds and sought refuge in the Leopoldstadt theatre.\n\nWe attended a prelude featuring Schuster. He plays an elderly merchant with a young wife to perfection—there is a certain ironic wisdom in the character that resonates deeply with the human condition. We then watched *Die Zauberbirn* again. The magic is charming, of course, but it is the interplay of human will and circumstance that truly engages the intellect.\n\nI think of you constantly. The distance feels great, yet our minds remain close. I shall send word soon.\n\nYour affectionate,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795219034,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":172,"prompt_tokens":908,"total_tokens":1080,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-x6cp3ZamuxhgWmYRD45pnjwq9fbjNUaz","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":908,"prompt_ms":910.959,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0032588105726872,"prompt_per_second":996.7517747780088,"predicted_n":172,"predicted_ms":4041.556,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.634830409356724,"predicted_per_second":42.31043687134361}}